From b5b26159dba20fe670374047d8d186cbf3ee6680 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rohit Gudi <50377477+caretak3r@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:03:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] build(hip0025-wire): plain chart-v3 lifecycle for the
 HIP-0025 e2e suite (harness only)

Upstream main cannot install chart-v3 releases, so every e2e tier carries this
layer: release/v2 storage in action.Configuration, v3 install/upgrade/rollback/
uninstall that apply everything at once (chart v2 semantics), lifecycle hooks,
--rollback-on-failure, template/lint/get/status for v3. Seams in wire_v3.go let
wire/ordered (PR1 trees) and wire/readiness (PR3 trees) plug in. Never pushed.

Signed-off-by: Rohit Gudi <50377477+caretak3r@users.noreply.github.com>
